<title>GREECE: IONIAN BANK ATMS OUT OF ORDER FRI-SAT.</title>
<headline>IONIAN BANK ATMS OUT OF ORDER FRI-SAT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Ionian Bank said its network of automated teller machines ATMs nationwide will be inoperable on Friday September 27 from 2230 local until Saturday 0900 due to a systems upgrade.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
